# Kept out of ripgrep searches (Claude Code's Grep/Glob and Codex both use rg), so a search
# returns code instead of megabytes of generated data. Files are still in git and can be
# opened directly. .gitignore already covers data/, .venv/ and caches.

# The landing page's built 3D city data and textures
docs/site/la/
# Diagrams and screenshots
docs/images/
# Rendered reports (the .md and .html sources are searchable)
docs/results/*.pdf
# Generated or large reference data
fixtures/venues_socal.json
fixtures/labels.second.jsonl
fixtures/review/
fixtures/venue_aliases*.json
*.bin
